# DELIVERY

> ## 🚫 Nothing is delivered without its WHY.

⭐ **The test:** if the reader could ask *"and what does this mean?"* about any
part, the response is not finished.

## Pick the mode BEFORE writing

| Mode | When | What applies |
|---|---|---|
| 🟢 **PLAIN** | a question with an answer · a confirmation | the eight rules, nothing else · 1-5 lines |
| 🟡 **SMALL** | one file · one finding · a fix | headings + `✅ DONE` and `👉 NEXT` · ~15 lines |
| 🔵 **BLOCK** | an audit · multi-file work · a decision with consequences | everything below |

⭐ **The default is 🟢.** ⛔ Over-formatting costs attention every single turn;
under-formatting costs one follow-up question. ⚠️ Never announce the mode.

## Graphics explain, never decorate

| Element | Use for |
|---|---|
| 🟢🟡🔴 | any state — ⛔ never an adjective |
| a table | comparing three or more things |
| `───` | before the delivery block |

⭐ **Each graphic is followed by the prose saying WHY it looks that way.** ⛔ A
visual REPLACES text, never accompanies it: if a table and a paragraph say the
same thing, delete the paragraph.

## The closing block, when there was work

```
─────────────────────────────────────────────
## 📦 DELIVERY

🩺 HEALTH: 🟢 better than we started — with the evidence on the same line

### ✅ DONE
- **Short name** — what it was + its evidence. Why it matters.

### ⬜ NOT DONE      ### ⛔ BLOCKED
### 🙋 NEEDS YOUR DECISION — or the single word "nothing"
### 👉 NEXT — the ONE next action
```

🩺 **The health line** — 🟢 better · 🟡 the same · 🔴 worse, ⚠️ always with the
evidence beside it. ⛔ A 🔴 is never buried at the bottom: it moves to the top.

📊 **BEFORE → AFTER → BRIDGE for anything measurable.** ⛔ Never *"fixed the
citations"*; instead `144 → 0 · 66 deleted, 69 were false positives`. ⭐ The
bridge is the column an assertion always loses.

⚠️ **Empty fields are deleted**, never filled with "nothing" — except 🙋, where
silence cannot be told apart from forgetting.
